{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_01",
      "hash": "9b331b30012b8d54",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「唉～\\n阪木老大也失蹤了。\\c\\n火箭隊以後\\n到底會變成怎樣呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_01",
      "hash": "f513190d032dd680",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「真是的！\\n別在那裡磨磨蹭蹭的啦！\\c\\n阪木老大是何等人物！\\n他一定只是暫時躲起來，\\c\\n為下一次的陰謀做準備而已！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_02",
      "hash": "9b331e30012b926d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「……說的也是！\\c\\n那為了幫阪木老大出一份力，\\c\\n我們就把全世界的寶可夢\\n通通搶來吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub057_nyasu_01",
      "hash": "c012f4669301ba14",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵「……喵！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_03",
      "hash": "9b331d30012b90ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「啊！是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳！\\n之前那個小鬼頭！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_02",
      "hash": "f5131c0d032ddb99",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「我說[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳啊！\\n幹嘛偷聽別人說話！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_04",
      "hash": "9b331830012b883b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「我們可不會放過\\n妨礙火箭隊的人！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_05",
      "hash": "9b331730012b8688",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「話說，[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳只有１隻寶可夢\\n是要怎麼跟我們對戰啊！\\c\\n給我回去再帶１隻\\n寶可夢過來啦！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_03",
      "hash": "f5131b0d032dd9e6",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「明明只是個小鬼頭，\\n為什麼會那麼強啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_04",
      "hash": "f5131e0d032ddeff",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……果然是因為那隻[VAR POKNAME(0002)]吧？\\c\\n也許是因為跟牠在一起，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳才能發揮全力也說不定。"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_06",
      "hash": "9b331a30012b8ba1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「只要有那隻[VAR POKNAME(0002)]，\\n想征服世界也不是問題！\\c\\n……你們要不要加入火箭隊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub057_select_01",
      "hash": "99ed86d8cab4fdfc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不要"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_sub057_select_02",
      "hash": "99ed89d8cab50315",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "唔……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_07",
      "hash": "9b331930012b89ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「也是啦……\\c\\n呵呵……\\n我們果然還是得當敵人啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_08",
      "hash": "9b331430012b816f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "不過要是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳改變主意，\\n歡迎隨時來找我們！\\c\\n我手製的這個\\n就送[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_sub057_sys_01",
      "hash": "110170328e829b63",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]從火箭隊那裡\\n得到了[VAR COLOR(0006)]感覺好好套裝[VAR COLOR(0000)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_sub057_sys_02",
      "hash": "110171328e829d16",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]把[VAR COLOR(0006)]感覺好好套裝[VAR COLOR(0000)]\\n放進了換裝箱！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_05",
      "hash": "f5131d0d032ddd4c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「…………\\c\\n哎呀！\\n這種清爽的感覺是怎樣？\\c\\n想不到我們跟[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳這死對頭\\n也會有這種時候呢……"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_sub057_kojiro_09",
      "hash": "9b331330012b7fbc",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "小次郎「偶爾這樣也不錯啊？"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_06",
      "hash": "f513200d032de265",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "武藏「也是呢！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_sub057_musashi_07",
      "hash": "f5131f0d032de0b2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "火箭隊「好好的感覺～！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_sub057_nyasu_02",
      "hash": "c012f7669301bf2d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "喵喵「啥喵～喵！喵！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_sub_event_057_max",
      "hash": "a82e1393f0b0d24e"
    }
  ]
}
